        "official_en_sha256": "928ea08dbcb94cf68e9cc797303fe2fc5820d3bb800d6297b047ae390b4991da"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "その度ごとにクリスタルの大地は\r\n人間の思いを受け止めてきたのだ。",
        "official_en": "The hatred and horror of each atrocity, <text style=\"italic\">etched</> into this land of crystals.",
        "real_en": "Every time, the land of the Crystals has borne the weight of humanity's feelings."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
