        "official_en_sha256": "4a21c1c5355788a9e042eee81e2fae8d198c8469329df1d5ae4a33bb378e9daa"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "まさか、大地に宿った人間の悪意を\r\nビジョンとして呼び出したのか……！",
        "official_en": "It’s a vision...of all the malice that soaked into the land...",
        "real_en": "Could he have summoned the malice buried in this land as a Vision!?"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
