      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "水華と光輝が命と引き換えに\r\n俺たちを先へと進めてくれたんだ。",
        "official_en": "Alluvion and Lux gave their lives so we could keep going.",
        "real_en": "Water Bloom Veritas and Radiance Veritas gave their lives to help us keep going."
